# Store admin CRUD

Scaffolding templates: the `store-admin-crud` skill. Reference pages: `storeAdmin/(dashboard)/[storeId]/(routes)/product-option-template/` and `.../facility/`.

## Files

```
storeAdmin/(dashboard)/[storeId]/(routes)/<feature>/
  page.tsx                 server component: loads rows, maps them to the column type
  <feature>-column.ts      row type for the table (no BigInt, no Prisma types)
  components/
    client-<feature>.tsx   list with local state; exports <Feature>Client
    columns.tsx            TanStack column definitions
    cell-action.tsx        row menu (edit, delete with confirm)
    edit-<feature>-dialog.tsx  create and edit form
```

Actions: `web/src/actions/storeAdmin/<domain>/create-<entity>.ts`, `update-<entity>.ts`, `delete-<entity>.ts` (or one `upsert-`), each with a `.validation.ts`. Route folders are kebab-case; components are PascalCase named exports.

## Client state

- The client list holds rows in `useState`; `handleCreated`, `handleUpdated` and `handleDeleted` patch it. No `router.refresh()` for list data.
- Dialogs call the action and pass the saved row up on success.
- Filters are local state plus `useMemo`. Use the shared `DataTable` (`@/components/dataTable`) and `DataTableColumnHeader` (`@/components/dataTable-column-header`).
- Dates are BigInt epoch in the database; map them to strings on the server page.

Forms: `form-handling.mdc`. Import and export: `import-export-pattern.mdc`.
